Recommends: pipewire-pulse
Description: HeyMa Wax audio recorder and transcription pipeline
 Wax is the single-owner audio pipeline for HeyMa: record, archive, transcribe,
 and enrich. This package installs the wax and waxd command-line tools, the
 tray indicator, and a systemd user unit. Clicking the Wax application icon
 starts the waxd daemon.
